Package: BirdFlowR
Title: Predict and Visualize Bird Movement
Version: 1.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Ethan", "Plunkett",  email = "plunkett@umass.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4405-2251")),
      person("BirdFlow-Science", role = "cph"),
      person("National Science Foundation", role = "fnd"))
Description: Predict and visualize where and when birds move using models derived 
    from observations submitted by birders to eBird.
    Core functions allow generating synthetic migration routes, and projecting bird 
    distributions forward or backwards in time.
    Additional functions allow estimating migratory traffic, routing birds between specific locations,
    and importing and exporting data from and to various spatial formats. 
